## ─── Build Artifacts (rebuilt inside container) ─────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/

## ─── Git & CI ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.gitignore

## ─── Tests (not needed in production image) ──────────────────────────────────
tests/

## ─── Frontend (separate build pipeline) ─────────────────────────────────────
client/

## ─── Secrets & Local Environment ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.Staging.json

## ─── IDE & OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.vs/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## ─── Docs & Scripts (not needed in image) ───────────────────────────────────
docs/
scripts/
*.md
generate_docs.py
